I think I think it goes back to putting your&nbsp;
pride aside you know i've come from a very humble&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:17.600
educational documentary film beginning and then&nbsp;
was very fortunate to to run a company that did&nbsp;&nbsp;

